WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:05.083
In this walkthrough, we add the Banner widget to a page slot and open its settings.

2
00:00:05.083 --> 00:00:07.389
This matters because each widget type has its own purpose, and choosing the right widget keeps the page easier to maintain.

3
00:00:07.389 --> 00:00:08.941
Start in All Slots on a page editor so you can add the Banner widget in context.

4
00:00:08.941 --> 00:00:11.069
Expand the Main Content slot so its widget controls are visible.

5
00:00:11.069 --> 00:00:13.060
Click the plus icon on the Main Content slot.

6
00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:15.080
Choose Banner widget from the widget picker.

7
00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:17.094
Open the settings panel for the new Banner widget.

8
00:00:17.094 --> 00:00:18.806
Configure the fields, then save and preview the page before publishing.

9
00:00:18.806 --> 00:00:21.117
After this walkthrough, you should know where to add the Banner widget and where to continue configuring it.
